    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99da60cfe85179caabda0484",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而新宇宙，也正是如此祈愿着——\r\n才会跨越星海……来到此处。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d7c4c39d1ede291a7f360b5d33335fd2f83b584db16ac981b9136301cd4a8bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
