    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90c29d4abe3449232b3d0924",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "请你也多多照顾了……！\r\n这最新的高潮章节，就由我们来书写吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c659b0d32a5d390f25c114767cb47f99442d4b48849abe6c84e684070385fefc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105301.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        58,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/58/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d06a811c4f91f2a755b02792",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "历尽艰辛，我们终于抵达这崭新的宙域。\r\n而我们现在最该做的事情，便是与荒漠英雄一同，\r\n追寻这终于求得的“现在”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaf4f77f16e6f72dfc97bd712bc40a21336a485d8e062e5842e59d5f54f6bd46",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105301.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        59,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b407ba3317cc2f1c440cb383",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "未知的少女——正立于此处。\r\n这就是，所有宇宙中“唯一”的新宇宙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c992c94334d5bbdca397a0795f2c88fb04936717296b828d3f2851790186752",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105301.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8cabb5ae5f9e3b62ad696be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "本应无法共同跨越盛夏之门的二人，如今——",
      "source_fingerprint": "8363e584c1421b7fd78d2322a5c8046b3b1b37c48584c6fdc7c3cca0d2968481",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
